{
    "chapter_num": 13,
    "verses_count": 22,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Firstborn Consecrated"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " spoke to Moses, saying, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Consecrate"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Set apart"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to Me all the firstborn, whatever opens the womb among the children of Israel, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "both"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of man and beast; it is Mine.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Feast of Unleavened Bread"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Moses said to the people: “Remember this day in which you went out of Egypt, out of the house of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. slaves"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "bondage; for by strength of hand the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " brought you out of this "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "place."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " No leavened bread shall be eaten. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "On this day you are going out, in the month Abib. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And it shall be, when the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " brings you into the land of the Canaanites and the Hittites and the Amorites and the Hivites and the Jebusites, which He swore to your fathers to give you, a land flowing with milk and honey, that you shall keep this service in this month. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Seven days you shall eat unleavened bread, and on the seventh day "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "there shall be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a feast to the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ". "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Unleavened bread shall be eaten seven days. And no leavened bread shall be seen among you, nor shall leaven be seen among you in all your quarters. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And you shall tell your son in that day, saying, ‘"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "This is done"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " because of what the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " did for me when I came up from Egypt.’ "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "It shall be as a sign to you on your hand and as a memorial between your eyes, that the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "’s law may be in your mouth; for with a strong hand the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " has brought you out of Egypt. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "You shall therefore keep this "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "regulation"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "ordinance in its season from year to year."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Law of the Firstborn"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“And it shall be, when the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " brings you into the land of the Canaanites, as He swore to you and your fathers, and gives it to you, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "that you shall "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. cause to pass over"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "set apart to the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " all that open the womb, that is, every firstborn that comes from an animal which you have; the males "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "shall be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "’s. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But every firstborn of a donkey you shall redeem with a lamb; and if you will not redeem "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " then you shall break its neck. And all the firstborn of man among your sons you shall redeem. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So it shall be, when your son asks you in time to come, saying, ‘What "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " this?’ that you shall say to him, ‘By strength of hand the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " brought us out of Egypt, out of the house of bondage. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And it came to pass, when Pharaoh was stubborn about letting us go, that the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " killed all the firstborn in the land of Egypt, both the firstborn of man and the firstborn of beast. Therefore I sacrifice to the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " all males that open the womb, but all the firstborn of my sons I redeem.’ "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "It shall be as a sign on your hand and as frontlets between your eyes, for by strength of hand the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " brought us out of Egypt.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Wilderness Way"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then it came to pass, when Pharaoh had let the people go, that God did not lead them "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "by"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " way of the land of the Philistines, although that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " near; for God said, “Lest perhaps the people change their minds when they see war, and return to Egypt.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So God led the people around "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "by"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " way of the wilderness of the Red Sea. And the children of Israel went up in orderly ranks out of the land of Egypt."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Moses took the bones of Joseph with him, for he had placed the children of Israel under solemn oath, saying, “God will surely "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "give attention to"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "visit you, and you shall carry up my bones from here with you.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So they took their journey from Succoth and camped in Etham at the edge of the wilderness. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " went before them by day in a pillar of cloud to lead the way, and by night in a pillar of fire to give them light, so as to go by day and night. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He did not take away the pillar of cloud by day or the pillar of fire by night "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "from"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " before the people."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}